              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 7:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka jotieko tuco mikwenda pajo, ogwaŋ ma lawok i mwombe bino lwenyo gi jo, to loyo jo gi meni to neko jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.1.9+ISA.1.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 1:9-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka delkwoŋ jo bino m'oyerere i royo ma tindi madwoŋ, kama Rwoth pajo ogur'iye kwoŋ musalaba, ma nyinge iy'ageca ilwoŋo ni Sodom kosa Misir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji ma nonin je, gi dhodhok je jobino neno delkwoŋ jono tieko ndelo adek g'adec, aka jok'oyey woyiki jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji ma piny jobino kisangala gi tho pa jario me. Jobino rweyere to jomiyere mic, rupiri jotuci wac Were ario no onwaŋo jokelo litho madit ri ji ma piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.37.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eze 37:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumacen munyo ndelo adek g'adec no orumo, luya ma kelo kwo owok i dhok Were to donjo kwoŋ jo, to joay malo; lworo madwoŋ omako ji je ma ceŋino joneko jono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.2.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kerin 2:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo jotuci wac ario no jowinjo dwondi nyatoro m'oluwo malo i polo ka waco rijo ni, “Biye win ka!” Jono joidho polo gi pondeponde ruwaŋ jokwor pajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 6:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.16.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hongo no won, yengirok madwoŋ ma piny otimere. Acel kwoŋ apar ma tindi oŋinyere woko, aka ji ma romo gana abirio jotho i yengirok ma piny no. Ji m'odoŋ jobwok to jopako dwoŋ pa Were ma polo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
