        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo malaika mar'abirio okudho gwara pere, to dwondi nyatoro ma koko malo wok i polo, ka waco ni, “Meni Ma dhumo piny pama obedo apa Rwoth kodi Kristo pere, aka go bino dhumo cil gi cil!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
